// "When this artifact enters, surveil 1. {2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Choose
// one — Cloak the top card of your library; Goad target creature; Draw a card."
// [CR#701.58a]
SingleFaced(face: (
    characteristics: (
        name: "Ransom Note",
        cost: [1],
        types: [Artifact],
        subtypes: [clue],
        text: [
            triggered(enters(asType(type: Artifact, subject: this, subtype: None)), surveil(1)),
            activated(
                compound([mana([2]), perform(sacrifice(this))]),
                chooseModes(exactly(1), [
                    (None, cloak(librarySlice(Top, 1, you))),
                    (None, goad(target(creature))),
                    (None, draw(1)),
                ]),
            ),
        ],
    ),
))
